###Combine

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}3\blueE{x}-2\maroonD{y}+\goldE{8}-\goldE{3}
\\\\
&=3\blueE{x}-2\maroonD{y}+\goldE{5}
\end{align}$

We cannot combine $3\blueE{x}-2\maroonD{y}$ since they aren't like terms.
